Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**Merged as one issue — then split.** The pile looked like one parser bug. Cause grouping shows
two mechanisms under the same merge. See [two problems under one ticket](/kb/incidents/4471-two-problems).

<Callout>
Known. Two problems: `parser` (379) and `hint` (33). Separate tickets filed; this page keeps the merge history.
</Callout>

